              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Barbe"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family is Greek. Thanks for choosing lemon juice over vinegar! We always add some green or red pepper. And thanks for specifying Greek black olives…Greek kalamata are the only ones to use!",
            "datePublished": "2024-01-13T20:00:57.594Z"
