              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "txtj"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this recipe. I eat this as a meal or a snack. \nI use a little less onion and add whole Kalamata olives. \nIn a pinch, sub the seasonings for Italian salad dressing. Quick and easy! \nAlso, if you let this sit, the tomatoes will start to break down. If you don't like the liquid, either drain it or eat it right away.",
