            },
            "reviewBody": "Came out great! I like someone suggested only put in 3T fresh lemon juice and 1T of red wine vinegar. I also added in the oregano,salt and pepper with the mix, tossed and refrigerated covered for a few hours. I used Mediterranean flavored feta.",
